cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ICMM in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ICMM: Ion Channel Model Maker"
abstract: >-
  ICMM fits Markov-state kinetic models of ion channels to voltage-clamp
  summary data, searching many candidate topologies with CMA-ES on a laptop
  or a SLURM cluster.
authors:
  - family-names: Schoening
    given-names: Max
    affiliation: Washington University in St. Louis
version: 1.0.0-rc.5
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - ion channels
  - Markov models
  - electrophysiology
  - patch clamp
  - CMA-ES
